WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.310 --> 00:00:02.190
We're switching things up a bit.

00:00:02.190 --> 00:00:04.310
It's hot out there.

00:00:04.310 --> 00:00:05.143
Humid.

00:00:05.143 --> 00:00:08.320
Of course, people still
stressed about COVID

00:00:08.320 --> 00:00:09.250
and all the rest

00:00:09.250 --> 00:00:11.810
so I thought, maybe we
should just get together

00:00:11.810 --> 00:00:14.520
and kind of chill people out

00:00:14.520 --> 00:00:18.170
with something we call
"Summer S'mores with Conan"

00:00:18.170 --> 00:00:21.121
and of course, the Chill Chums.

00:00:21.121 --> 00:00:22.960
(Matt laughing slowly)

00:00:22.960 --> 00:00:23.920
Oh wow, that's great, Matt.

00:00:23.920 --> 00:00:24.938
What a great laugh.

00:00:24.938 --> 00:00:27.004
(Matt laughing)
That's a great laugh.

00:00:27.004 --> 00:00:28.530
(all laughing)
Oh man.

00:00:28.530 --> 00:00:29.902
I'm a Chill Chum!

00:00:29.902 --> 00:00:34.902
That is not the laugh or the
demeanor of a Chill Chum.

00:00:37.550 --> 00:00:38.820
That was horrible.

00:00:38.820 --> 00:00:40.250
I think you're forgetting
the premise of this.

00:00:40.250 --> 00:00:44.300
Sona and I are the Chill Chums
and we teach you to be chill.

00:00:44.300 --> 00:00:46.300
And take it from a Chill Chum:

00:00:46.300 --> 00:00:48.180
that's a Chill Chum Chuckle.

00:00:48.180 --> 00:00:49.013
[Sona] Yeah.

00:00:49.013 --> 00:00:53.290
Okay, well, I chafe at
your Chill Chum Chuckle.

00:00:53.290 --> 00:00:54.123
[Matt] Ooh!

00:00:54.123 --> 00:00:58.450
Yeah, I don't like it.

00:00:58.450 --> 00:01:00.420
And also, I resent this whole idea

00:01:00.420 --> 00:01:05.337
that I'm the uptight,
you know, type A Grinch.

00:01:08.550 --> 00:01:13.550
I think that I'm very
capable of being zen.

00:01:14.190 --> 00:01:15.050
[Matt] Hmm.
[Sona] Ah.

00:01:15.050 --> 00:01:18.411
And doing my Buddha belly breathing.

00:01:18.411 --> 00:01:19.409
[Sona] What?

00:01:19.409 --> 00:01:23.950
I think I exude calm.

00:01:23.950 --> 00:01:24.783
[Sona] What?
Well the fact

00:01:24.783 --> 00:01:27.320
that you resent this means
that you're not very chill,

00:01:27.320 --> 00:01:29.320
'cause a Chill Chum would
just let it, you know,

00:01:29.320 --> 00:01:30.253
blow over him.

00:01:31.400 --> 00:01:33.133
Yeah but you really grate.

00:01:34.030 --> 00:01:36.397
When you're sitting there going,

00:01:36.397 --> 00:01:39.370
"Hey, be a Chill Chum!"

00:01:39.370 --> 00:01:41.650
and I can see you 'cause
we're on a Zoom call right now

00:01:41.650 --> 00:01:44.303
and I can see that you
have banjos behind you.

00:01:45.210 --> 00:01:46.150
One banjo.

00:01:46.150 --> 00:01:49.414
You have four banjos, I'm counting them.

00:01:49.414 --> 00:01:50.247
[Sona] What?

00:01:50.247 --> 00:01:51.151
What?

00:01:51.151 --> 00:01:52.260
You have an array

00:01:52.260 --> 00:01:56.280
of tweed hats with feathers
in them, Tyrolean--

00:01:56.280 --> 00:01:57.450
You have a vintage guitar

00:01:57.450 --> 00:02:00.133
and a bust of Teddy Roosevelt behind you.

00:02:01.020 --> 00:02:03.790
No, the bust of Teddy
Roosevelt was torn down.

00:02:03.790 --> 00:02:05.630
It was ripped down by,

00:02:05.630 --> 00:02:07.380
some protestors got into my house

00:02:07.380 --> 00:02:09.395
and tore down my bust of Teddy Roosevelt.

00:02:09.395 --> 00:02:12.390
(all laughing)

00:02:12.390 --> 00:02:14.613
And by protestors I mean my two children.

00:02:16.531 --> 00:02:18.270
(laughing) My daughter and my son came in

00:02:18.270 --> 00:02:19.103
and tore it down.

00:02:19.103 --> 00:02:21.440
Let's not start this with animosity.

00:02:21.440 --> 00:02:23.950
Being a Chill Chum is
all about being friends.

00:02:23.950 --> 00:02:25.900
I know, you're already, like,

00:02:25.900 --> 00:02:27.950
breaking all kinds of chill rules.

00:02:27.950 --> 00:02:29.290
[Matt] Yeah.

00:02:29.290 --> 00:02:30.160
Well, okay.

00:02:30.160 --> 00:02:31.860
[Sona] You're like, anti-chill.

00:02:31.860 --> 00:02:33.450
Your chill factor is zero, man.

00:02:33.450 --> 00:02:34.640
You're the opposite of chill.

00:02:34.640 --> 00:02:35.940
If we come into this chill,

00:02:35.940 --> 00:02:37.460
you, like, de-chill us.

00:02:37.460 --> 00:02:39.107
So you just gotta--
That's right.

00:02:39.107 --> 00:02:40.460
You're a Heat Miser.

00:02:40.460 --> 00:02:42.140
Just chill, man.

00:02:42.140 --> 00:02:43.910
You know, it's nice to
have two Chill Chums

00:02:43.910 --> 00:02:46.860
that just tell me everything
that's wrong with me,

00:02:46.860 --> 00:02:48.770
barrage me with criticism.

00:02:48.770 --> 00:02:51.890
That really does help
create a chill environment.

00:02:51.890 --> 00:02:52.900
[Matt] Hey, man.

00:02:52.900 --> 00:02:53.798
[Conan] Hey, man.
[Sona] Just chill,

00:02:53.798 --> 00:02:54.767
just chill.
[Conan] I'm a Chill Chum.

